Translate chemical usefulness into identity, composition, physical form and acceptance evidence (@ic-specification: 0, is #chapter, #part-of @industrial-chemistry, #source "../sources/Speciality-Inorganic-Chemicals-BREF.lingua#r_04G7NFYXE76QCB3DXCRJC1FSCP", #source "../sources/Organic-Fine-Chemicals-BREF.lingua#r_0DH473049K4WX7HAAY1P7SDS3K", #source "../sources/Large-Volume-Organic-Chemicals-BREF.lingua#r_78ET6A4D7AX8HPQTYAMZMAG16B", #industrial-chemistry "../processes/Read-and-reconstruct-chemical-flowsheets.lingua#r_3YXSFY4TWHFHPMZ3N8HBXQC0J8", #chemical-supply-systems "../../../materials/chemical-feedstocks-and-supply-systems/quality/A-specification-agreed-between-actual-parties.lingua#r_3J12DD0DDF2HT8EJXNRC7NSE3E") { r_535PMG683E3954QDWW0ERTPYG8
**Read:** [Production of Speciality Inorganic Chemicals, BREF SIC](../sources/Speciality-Inorganic-Chemicals-BREF.lingua#r_04G7NFYXE76QCB3DXCRJC1FSCP), the complete general product-quality and relevant specialty-family chapters; [Manufacture of Organic Fine Chemicals, BREF OFC](../sources/Organic-Fine-Chemicals-BREF.lingua#r_0DH473049K4WX7HAAY1P7SDS3K), the whole product/isolation and quality-related treatment for the chosen case; [Production of Large Volume Organic Chemicals, BREF LVOC](../sources/Large-Volume-Organic-Chemicals-BREF.lingua#r_78ET6A4D7AX8HPQTYAMZMAG16B), a complete process chapter including product and downstream requirements.

A product specification connects intended function with measurable properties and a method of assessment. Identity and main-component amount are often necessary but insufficient. Water, trace metals, ions, organic residues, particles, color, molecular distribution, stability and packaging interaction may determine suitability.

Different uses require different evidence. A synthesis intermediate may tolerate a constituent that poisons a downstream catalyst. A solvent can meet a general assay while failing a water-sensitive operation. An electronic-process chemical needs an explicit contaminant panel and detection capability; a long string of purity digits cannot replace that panel.

Follow specification through production and storage. Isolation, drying, filtration, contact materials, filling, transport and aging can alter the qualified state. An analytical certificate refers to a particular material, sampling support, method and time. Process capability and the uncertainty of the acceptance measurement matter alongside a limit value.

**Work:** take a genuine externally published product specification and explain the purpose of each consequential requirement. Reconstruct how one complete process produces and preserves that state. Compare a second route on delivered accepted product, retaining uncertainty, untested contaminants and the observations needed to establish equivalence.

**Continue:** [Read a flowsheet as connected chemical transformations, separation duties and inventories](../processes/Read-and-reconstruct-chemical-flowsheets.lingua#r_3YXSFY4TWHFHPMZ3N8HBXQC0J8).

